{"ID":"20260916183232-tmcqf11","Spec":"3","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20260916183232-tmcqf11","tags":"emo文案,好想她,随笔,仿史铁生","title":"梧桐月","type":"doc","updated":"20260916184155"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260916183232-rq7vxl5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260916183232-rq7vxl5","updated":"20260916183232"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"对于我来说，冬天总是会发生很多事。笔记：\n朋友们，不是所有事都会有一个确定的结果的，或许连“所有事”这件事本身都是没有界限的玩意儿。那些好的结果坏的结果，各种不了了之和无疾而终，你又会想让它们给你带来什么呢？你又不想让它们带走你什么呢？有人说是过去的所有的经历塑造了一个人，可我看自己又过三年却是没有一点进步，一个根本的赌徒。\n日出日落，在海浪海浪的声潮，我只看见礁石一动不动，又可怜人的赤心到底也是一块普通礁石。日落月升，还有不少赶海人往银色沙滩趟去，趟过月色的海，还要趟入另一片黑色的海。趟过去，等太阳升起来，却发现海的对面只不过是又又几摊。"}]},{"ID":"20260916184051-ohlv9m5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260916184051-ohlv9m5","updated":"20260916184119"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"Pasted image 20260331172859"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/Pasted image 20260331172859-20260916184110-a65jb2e.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260916184139-wdrsb9m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260916184139-wdrsb9m","updated":"20260916184146"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"Pasted image 20260331172910"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/Pasted image 20260331172910-20260916183935-dztvms4.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260916184147-ys9sgo3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260916184147-ys9sgo3","updated":"20260916184155"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"Pasted image 20260331172914"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/Pasted image 20260331172914-20260916184155-ux8slay.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260916184049-nb6bcbu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260916184049-nb6bcbu","updated":"20260916184049"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"![[Pasted image 20260331172859.png|293]]\n![[Pasted image 20260331172910.png]]\n![[Pasted image 20260331172914.png|290]]\n梧桐月，又几只寒鸦栖，暗萧入夜"}]}]}